Apply `AGENTS.md` hardware safety rules. Unknown drivers start with G0; tweeters require verified HPF/limiter/mute; battery work requires matched cells, balanced BMS, fuse, NTC and supervised current-limited tests. Do not scale to four packs before G0-G5 pass.
